BioSymphony BioProspector

This public repository is a control-plane and planning toolkit. It does not
include raw biological datasets, private structures, unpublished sequences,
large search databases, provider work directories, model weights, credentials,
or execution logs.

Third-party bioinformatics tools referenced by the docs and ledgers are not
vendored here. Users are responsible for reviewing and complying with each
tool, dataset, database, and cloud provider license or terms before execution.

The included examples are compact public-safe planning examples. They are not
evidence of biological production, host validation, assay success, or clinical
utility.

BioSymphony contributors distribute the banner and control-plane diagram under
the MIT License in `LICENSE`.
